
  <sn><md>### Fertilizer Materials: Sources and Manufacture {.text-center}

![img](https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Manure_spreading_Hlokozi_2007_11_29.jpg/500px-Manure_spreading_Hlokozi_2007_11_29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail)

&gt; A fertilizer is any `organic or inorganic material` of natural or synthetic origin (other than liming materials) that is added to soils to `supply one or more essential nutrient` elements.
